{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"weak"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"id<MLNOfflineStorageDelegate>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNOfflineStorageDelegate"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"delegate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An offline storage object sends messages to its delegate to allow it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transform URLs before they are requested from the internet. This can be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"add or remove custom parameters, or reroute certain requests to other servers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or endpoints."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(py)delegate","title":"delegate","symbolKind":"property","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"delegate","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"delegate"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The receiver’s delegate."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/delegate"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/delegate"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.